description A HackerOS-first compiled programming language featuring a highly unique yet remarkably simple syntax. It includes a Rust-based backend, support for advanced memory management (Arena memory, unsafe blocks), traits, pattern matching, and is heavily tailored towards cybersecurity tools and ecosystem development.
